            "id": "214006bb-1d89-4fa9-969f-38255de96138",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you so much for your review and for recommending the home. We’re glad you enjoyed the clean, spacious layout, the shared living areas, and the well stocked kitchen for family meals. We appreciate your feedback regarding linens, beach towels, and parking clarity. Your comments have been noted and help us continue refining our guest information and experience. We’re also happy the pet friendly setup worked well for you, and we’d love to welcome you back again.",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "The house was clean, new, and spacious, with great shared spaces. However, it lacked some items that would have made it more comfortable. For example, there were no extra blankets or pillows, and only a few extra towels. The house also does not provide beach towels, which was not ideal.The kitchen was well stocked with essentials for cooking. It was perfect for family dinners. The listing states that parking is included, but it doesn’t specify that it is only for one car—this could have been communicated more clearly on the VRBO page.It was pet-friendly, which was a great for us. Would recommend staying.",
